	(text_box "SHOCK_REQ: 100 k pull-down (contract §5.4). SN74LVC1G17 Schmitt buffer powered by 3V3_MAIN (consent buffer on its own rail,\ncontract §8): with 3V3_MAIN off its output is high impedance (Ioff) and the SW1 ON pull-down holds REQ_B low.\nREQ_B drives SW1, the window-start AND and the re-arm NOR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.77 31.75 0)
		(size 140 8.477)
