	)
	(text_box "LOWV_OK: 100 k pull-down (contract §5.4): comparator on sheet 07 unpowered = 'capacitor not known to be low' = no test mode.\nSN74LV1T gates (TTL-level inputs at 5 V, 5.5 V tolerant, no clamp diode to VCC: SCLS739F §8.3.3) take the 3.3 V signals into the 5V0_SYS logic, so an unpowered 5V0_SYS cannot be back-fed from either\ncontroller's rail. Every internal 'allow' node has a 100 k pull-down: a dead gate reads 'not allowed'.\nTEST_MODE_I drives SW2b, the window-start OR and, through 1 k, the global TEST_MODE to sheet 12 (100 k pull-down there). TM_N (= NOT TEST_MODE) enables the charger gates and SW5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 877.05 225.012 0)
		(size 232.475 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
