	)
	(text_box "Two independent two-gate chains, one per enable; the charger on sheet 10 needs BOTH (eFuse supply and CHARGE pin), so one stuck-high gate in either chain still leaves HOLD_OK gating the charger through the other.\nCHG_SESSION and CHG_RUN: 100 k pull-downs (contract §5.5); the SN74LV1T08 input is the Ioff-type buffer on the reader's rail (R7) instead of a separate buffer on 3V3_MAIN (capture notes: departure DEP-2).\nOff-time after HOLD_OK or TEST_MODE changes: two gate delays (< 50 ns) plus the 1 k / 100 k output network: far inside the 1 ms the contract asks (§10 WP-D with WP-E). Pull-downs of VTRANS_EN and CHARGE_EN are on\nsheet 10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 268.222 0)
		(size 244.46 10.636)
